    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>工作坊及黑客松工作坊採小組方式進行，由教師及評審委員評分。</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "課堂禮儀Classrooms Protocol\n　　多元化和包容性 Diversity and Inclusion\n　　　*課堂中須尊重同學之發言All students are expected to show respect for others’ opinions and comments during class\n　　課堂行為 Expected classroom behavior\n　　　*課堂中宜積極參與討論Students are expected to engage actively in class discussions\n課程交流及網路禮儀Course Communication and Netiquette Guidelines\n　　　*課堂中之討論與發言不得牽涉人身攻擊Personal attacks are strictly prohibited during class discussions and presentations\n學生責任Student Responsibilities\n　　　*準時到課Students are expected to attend class on time\n　　　*期限內繳交各項指定作業All assignments must be submitted by the designated deadlines",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>1.同學各項作業或報告過程中，必須謹守學術倫理，不得有抄襲、不當引用等情事發生。</div>\n\n<div>2.同學在應用AI工具輔助過程中，必須善盡查證職責，確保各項資料真實性。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
